# Personal message logs used as feedback input — must never be committed.
# The real files live OUTSIDE this repo (in the parent Documents folder) and
# have never been tracked; these patterns are a guard in case a copy is ever
# dropped in here. Deliberately name-free.
*message*.txt
*messages*.txt

# Stray scratch dumps written to the repo root with a flattened absolute path
# (an 18 MB raw GAME_MASTER dump reached a commit this way on 2026-09-10).
# Scratch files belong in the session scratchpad, never here.
/Users*AppData*
*gm_dump.json
